    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set on an outstanding elevated landscaped site with unrivalled panoramic views of the surrounding countryside, this charming three-bedroom bungalow offers an exceptional opportunity to enjoy peaceful rural living without compromising on convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ideally positioned just a two-minute drive from the vibrant village of Doon, the property enjoys easy access to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés, sporting facilities, and everyday services. Limerick City is also within a comfortable commuting distance, making this an ideal home for those seeking a tranquil setting while remaining well connected.\r\n\r\nThe residence stands proudly on a beautifully landscaped site, where the elevated position maximises the breathtaking views across the rolling hinterland. The mature gardens provide an attractive and private outdoor space, perfect for relaxing, entertaining, or simply taking in the spectacular surroundings.\r\n\r\nCombining a sought-after location, picturesque setting, and excellent accessibility, this delightful bungalow presents a wonderful opportunity for families, downsizers, or anyone looking to embrace country living in a truly scenic location."
      },
      {
